<section class="home-reviews-wall section-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="home-reviews-wall__inner">
    {% if section.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="home-reviews-wall__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
    {% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.subheading != blank %}
      <p class="home-reviews-wall__subheading">{{ section.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    {% capture reviews_cards %}
      {% if section.blocks.size > 0 %}
        {% for block in section.blocks %}
          <article class="home-reviews-wall__card">
            <p class="home-reviews-wall__stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</p>
            {% if block.settings.name != blank %}
              <h3 class="home-reviews-wall__name">{{ block.settings.name | escape }}</h3>
            {% endif %}
            <p class="home-reviews-wall__verified">
              <span class="home-reviews-wall__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              Verified buyer
            </p>
            {% if block.settings.review != blank %}
              <p class="home-reviews-wall__text">{{ block.settings.review | escape }}</p>
            {% endif %}
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
        {% assign reviews_mod = section.blocks.size | modulo: 2 %}
        {% if reviews_mod == 1 %}
          {% for block in section.blocks limit: 1 %}
            <article class="home-reviews-wall__card">
              <p class="home-reviews-wall__stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</p>
              {% if block.settings.name != blank %}
                <h3 class="home-reviews-wall__name">{{ block.settings.name | escape }}</h3>
              {% endif %}
              <p class="home-reviews-wall__verified">
                <span class="home-reviews-wall__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                Verified buyer
              </p>
              {% if block.settings.review != blank %}
                <p class="home-reviews-wall__text">{{ block.settings.review | escape }}</p>
              {% endif %}
            </article>
          {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
      {% else %}
        <article class="home-reviews-wall__card">
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</p>
          <h3 class="home-reviews-wall__name">Robert Neumann</h3>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__verified"><span class="home-reviews-wall__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Verified buyer</p>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__text">Ninja Patches worked with me to ensure complete satisfaction with my volunteer organization's unit emblem. Everyone is thrilled with it, and I could not be more pleased with the experience. Highly recommend!</p>
        </article>
        <article class="home-reviews-wall__card">
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</p>
          <h3 class="home-reviews-wall__name">Ralph Arguelles</h3>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__verified"><span class="home-reviews-wall__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Verified buyer</p>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__text">This is now the second order from Ninja Patches. They are so clean and easy to apply. Customer service is top notch. I may get a little crazy with my next design, but I know they can handle it!</p>
        </article>
        <article class="home-reviews-wall__card">
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</p>
          <h3 class="home-reviews-wall__name">Donna Austin</h3>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__verified"><span class="home-reviews-wall__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Verified buyer</p>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__text">I have a small embroidery business and I was too tired to do an order for 25 patches, so I outsourced it to Ninja Patches. They did a better job than I could have done, and the price was right. I'll be back.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="home-reviews-wall__card">
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</p>
          <h3 class="home-reviews-wall__name">Lee Ingram</h3>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__verified"><span class="home-reviews-wall__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Verified buyer</p>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__text">Great quality and service!</p>
        </article>
        <article class="home-reviews-wall__card">
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</p>
          <h3 class="home-reviews-wall__name">Colin Schiess</h3>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__verified"><span class="home-reviews-wall__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Verified buyer</p>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__text">Awesome quality patches! We got these for our soccer team. Couldn't be happier with the quality and delivery speed. Thank you!</p>
        </article>
        <article class="home-reviews-wall__card">
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</p>
          <h3 class="home-reviews-wall__name">Lownice Hobson</h3>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__verified"><span class="home-reviews-wall__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Verified buyer</p>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__text">My design was pretty intricate and the patches look amazing!</p>
        </article>
        <article class="home-reviews-wall__card">
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</p>
          <h3 class="home-reviews-wall__name">Lena Lindsay</h3>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__verified"><span class="home-reviews-wall__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Verified buyer</p>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__text">Absolutely LOVE how my patches came out. Colors and detail definitely a 10+. Working on my next order right now.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="home-reviews-wall__card">
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</p>
          <h3 class="home-reviews-wall__name">Carlos Cariaga</h3>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__verified"><span class="home-reviews-wall__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Verified buyer</p>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__text">I am 1000 percent satisfied with the patches of my custom design. I will order from Ninja Patches again. They are by far the best patch provider I have used.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="home-reviews-wall__card">
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</p>
          <h3 class="home-reviews-wall__name">Bobby Martin</h3>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__verified"><span class="home-reviews-wall__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Verified buyer</p>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__text">Well first of all, I received the patches in great time. They were exactly what I ordered and once applying them is even better, once again great work!</p>
        </article>
        <article class="home-reviews-wall__card">
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</p>
          <h3 class="home-reviews-wall__name">Darrell DeVor</h3>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__verified"><span class="home-reviews-wall__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Verified buyer</p>
          <p class="home-reviews-wall__text">The PVC Velcro back patches came in great and looked better than expected. Quality is amazing and people like them right away.</p>
        </article>
      {% endif %}
    {% endcapture %}

    <div class="home-reviews-wall__scroller">
      <div class="home-reviews-wall__track">
        <div class="home-reviews-wall__grid">
          {{ reviews_cards }}
        </div>
        <div class="home-reviews-wall__grid" aria-hidden="true">
          {{ reviews_cards }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Home reviews wall",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-home-reviews-wall",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Custom Patches Backed by Incredible Reviews"
